@description "Dynamic Fallback Routing - Self-Healing Pipelines"

# 💡 TIP: Dispatch automatically tries candidates in order until one succeeds.
# 'not_found' doesn't exist, 'broken_service' doesn't exist.
# It gracefully falls back to 'const', successfully healing the request.

@assert: result == "I am the fallback!"

{ members: "not_found, broken_service, const", payload: { value: "I am the fallback!" } }
-> dispatch
